  "limits": [
    "Original cache glyph cells and complete original kerning are authoritative. Current-GDI supplements carry per-font/per-glyph provenance and are not claimed to match historical shipped raster pixels. Four initial Palatino alpha-nibble differences and the DEL127 difference are retained as measured comparison boundaries.",
    "Native text wrapping, font-style shadow dispatch and native alternate-face layers above U+052F remain unbound. Unsupported glyphs retain existing control text; current em-dash placeholders are reported.",
    "Bitmap siblings preserve existing nodes, accessible text, pointer/onclick/disabled behavior, OS inputs and selects. Canvas placement/clipping, HUD resource typography and the added calendar font role are explicit application adapters.",
    "Five previews replay positioned production source widgets and active glyph draw calls over a separately captured Native5 world. They are not browser CSS rasters or same-frame original screenshots; legacy flowing forms stay outside this raster transport.",
    "No full game or text-engine 1:1 parity claim. Native4/5 source and release snapshots remain historical and untouched."
